<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Techire half year earnings slide.</title>
<headline>Techire half year earnings slide.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended June 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     7.42	  vs 8.23</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		  -	    vs  -</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   0.94	  vs 1.04</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   1.64	  vs 1.52</p>
<p>    Tax			 0.70	  vs 0.47</p>
<p>    Interest paid	    -	    vs 0.01</p>
<p>    Turnover		  8.16	  vs 6.34</p>
<p>Full name: Technihire Ltd (industrial holding)</p>
<p>NOTE - Start-up costs of new divisions would result in an overall reduction in earnings in the full year, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
